CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'skb->data[0] == HCI_VENDOR_PKT'
#395: FILE: drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c:1063:
+	if ((skb->data[0] == HCI_VENDOR_PKT) &&
+	    (get_unaligned_be16((skb->data) + 2) == QCA_SSR_DUMP_HANDLE))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

